Before doing anything in this repository read `AGENTS.md`, then the ADRs named by your task in `docs/adr/`. They win over anything inferred from the code.

Non-negotiable: MIT tree with no copyleft dependencies; no telemetry; nothing phones home; never touch a byte of a user document the user did not ask to change; chrome at rest is zero; reading is primary.

Workflow: one story, one branch (`type/KEY-slug`), one PR, only the story's listed paths. Conventional commits with the key; no AI attribution trailers. Every acceptance criterion gets a test or gate in the same PR. `pnpm precheck` must be green before a PR and `pnpm done MARXY-nn` drafts the PR body; `docs/hygiene.md` lists what the hooks and checks enforce. Start new units with `pnpm new`.

If your task is orchestration, read `orchestration/README.md` and the prompt for your role in `orchestration/prompts/`.
